  - m_Id: 14408695813
    m_Key: Welcome aboard, Commander! Your ship is almost ready for its first battle,
      but one gun is still missing. Tap Build to open the ship builder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434673
  - m_Id: 14408695814
    m_Key: Blocks are sorted into categories. Tap Weapons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434674
  - m_Id: 14408695815
    m_Key: Drag the gun onto the free spot of your ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434675
  - m_Id: 14408695816
    m_Key: Tap the check mark to confirm the build.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434676
  - m_Id: 14408695817
    m_Key: Well done! Tap Save to keep your new ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434677
  - m_Id: 14408695818
    m_Key: Your ship is saved. Now leave the builder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434678
  - m_Id: 14408695819
    m_Key: Your ship is ready for battle. Tap Play!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434679
  - m_Id: 14408695820
    m_Key: Choose Campaign.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434680
  - m_Id: 14408695821
    m_Key: Select the first star system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434681
  - m_Id: 14408695822
    m_Key: Tap level 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434682
  - m_Id: 14408695823
    m_Key: Tap Play to launch the battle!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434683
  - m_Id: 14408695824
    m_Key: You've completed a task! Open Rewards to collect your prize.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434684
  - m_Id: 14408695825
    m_Key: Tap Claim to get your reward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434685
  - m_Id: 14408695826
    m_Key: You have enough research points to unlock shields! Open Research.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434686
  - m_Id: 14408695827
    m_Key: Tap the shield to research it. Shields stop enemy shots before they hit
      your ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434687
  - m_Id: 14408695828
    m_Key: 'Move your finger on the joystick to fly your ship. Your guns fire on
      their own: dodge enemy shots and destroy every enemy!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3148367012707434688
